  though he fights alongside the avengers  sometimes he doesn't serve as the  group's leader  like tony or capdo however a different  character involved with the eternals did  lead the avengers  kit harington's dane whitman whether or  not icarus or dane will eventually team  up with or even lead the avengers in any  future mcu films  is anyone's guess at this point either  way icarus and dane will both be able to  show off their leadership skills in  eternals when the film  hits theaters on november 5th check out  one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite comic book heroes and villains  are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

